        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Playable, fully voiced characters. Featuring JonBreaksBadNews as the Alchemist. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 NG+ difficulties. Can you defeat evil at its full force? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities, talent trees, and additional buffs to unlock to aid you in your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full compendium with lore and a close-up look at the art for every character, mob, boss, and summon available in the game, along with stat tracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 62 achievements. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/c73375730a2ffdaaa37c5c6035d0bddb.poster.avif?t=1770879825\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/c73375730a2ffdaaa37c5c6035d0bddb.webm?t=1770879825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/c73375730a2ffdaaa37c5c6035d0bddb.mp4?t=1770879825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/9b26263367325e9c3449aff4715bac43.poster.avif?t=1770879825\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/9b26263367325e9c3449aff4715bac43.webm?t=1770879825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/9b26263367325e9c3449aff4715bac43.mp4?t=1770879825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Lore:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;On the eve of October's thirtieth and first, when All Hallows' Eve falls upon the land, there doth arose from the bowels of the earth creatures most vile and twisted. Fiends of dread and darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These abominations, they shift and change, cloaking themselves in the semblance of man. Yet their hearts are naught but foul. In search of the strongest among the living, those whom the King of the Damned seeks to ensnare… to draw forth power most profane.&quot;</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Playable, fully voiced characters. Featuring JonBreaksBadNews as the Alchemist. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 NG+ difficulties. Can you defeat evil at its full force? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities, talent trees, and additional buffs to unlock to aid you in your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full compendium with lore and a close-up look at the art for every character, mob, boss, and summon available in the game, along with stat tracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 62 achievements. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/c73375730a2ffdaaa37c5c6035d0bddb.poster.avif?t=1770879825\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/c73375730a2ffdaaa37c5c6035d0bddb.webm?t=1770879825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/c73375730a2ffdaaa37c5c6035d0bddb.mp4?t=1770879825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/9b26263367325e9c3449aff4715bac43.poster.avif?t=1770879825\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/9b26263367325e9c3449aff4715bac43.webm?t=1770879825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564270/extras/9b26263367325e9c3449aff4715bac43.mp4?t=1770879825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Lore:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;On the eve of October's thirtieth and first, when All Hallows' Eve falls upon the land, there doth arose from the bowels of the earth creatures most vile and twisted. Fiends of dread and darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These abominations, they shift and change, cloaking themselves in the semblance of man. Yet their hearts are naught but foul. In search of the strongest among the living, those whom the King of the Damned seeks to ensnare… to draw forth power most profane.&quot;</p>",
